The MIT license covers original project code and documentation. It does not
relicense Amazon documentation, trademarks, or third-party packages. Numeric
rate snapshots are derived from published fee schedules; source URLs and dates
are included. Raw Amazon pages/PDFs and private operational evidence are not
distributed in this repository. Verify applicable fees against official sources.

The calculator has no third-party runtime package dependencies. Optional rate
monitoring uses pypdf (BSD-3-Clause), installed separately from PyPI with a pinned
version and hash. See https://github.com/py-pdf/pypdf/blob/main/LICENSE.

Community projects referenced for architectural ideas are listed in
docs/sources.md. Their calculator source code is not bundled or imported.
